SUMMARY:LEAF Global Arts Deep Roots Festival
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 30\, 2026 | 12:00pm – 11:00pm | Event Details and Tickets \n\n DEEP ROOTS • MAY 30\, 2026 \nThe beloved spring LEAF event returns in a new format this May: Deep Roots\, a full-day\, family friendly celebration at Pisgah Brewing Company.\n\n\nWe’re bringing the music\, the energy\, and the community back together again! Come reconnect with your roots… and your LEAF family. We can’t wait to see you!\n LINEUP\n• River Whyless\n• Corey Harris\n• Palmyra\n• MAMA\n• Lotus Feet\n• Ashley Heath\n• Adama Dembele\n• Nicholas Edward Williams\n• Mountain Circus Arts\n• Street Creature Puppet Collective\n\n\nFREE COMMUNITY PRE-PARTY w/ performance by • Petah Iah & The Mind Renewers\n\n\n~Live music~Vendors~Healing Arts~Workshops~Family Fun~\n\nmpany.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/leaf-global-arts-deep-roots-festival/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
