  a Birthday Party! AVL Digital Nomads has grown into the largest and most 
 impactful remote work community in the country — and we're celebrating t
 he way all good things should be celebrated: with beer\, a food truck\, an
 d zero mandatory icebreaker games. You're welcome. By the numbers (since y
 ou asked): 575 events. 18\,000 attendee registrations. 70 organizers. Near
LOCATION:Asheville\, NC
