SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Marta Martin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, June 19th\n\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFa
 cilitator \\| DJ Marta Martin\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ Marta Martin
 \n\nMarta (she/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to Asheville
  from Surfside\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for over 30 ye
 ars\, using music and movements from around the world. She loves to motiva
 te people to find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to the spirit.
  Listen to her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/]
 (https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExU
 Ew3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR62ri5Nrm8XWJL
 kmMMH3ledewNFoN8SdmekhAKysKK2fKvFGblgAhrOvfiGsQ_aem_tWcDHVFAH7DhKKPGxObWww
 ) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta](https://soundclo
 ud.com/dancingmarta?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e223_tv4_tp1&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0C
 MTAAYnJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR
 4ggbnEohOZ94TUnWPAicVHteJYL-Vbl-dWeYQnw59RnToTclK5Q1ESMI_QPQ_aem_4hciEUoMe
 8CEWfa0kdm6iQ) )\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts 
 at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come l
 ate will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure con
 tainer. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one tur
 ned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmF
 lam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLe
 rpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTE
 ER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volun
 teer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExM
 FZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1
 XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA
 )\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the ope
 ning circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCol
 lective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](
 https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMT
 AAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4X
 GdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1p
 ootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a worl
 d that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves wi
 thin a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity a
 nd healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for pe
 rsonal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organiza
 tion.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dan
 ce floor!
